ull/111066.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-06T14:13:03Z"},"body":"- Helps address https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111218\r\n\r\n`Memory` is currently a class. This is a bad fit because it is not meant to be constructed.\r\n\r\nChanging it into a `namespace` does not solve any problems (except for some stylistic workarounds). But it communicates the intent better, may _very slightly_ improve compile time, and allows us to split declarations into separate headers in the future if needed.\r\n\r\nI also took the opportunity to rename the memory usage properties, to make the names clearer. This is also what helps address https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111218, by removing the `safe_ref_count.h` include.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111066/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111066/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}